{
    "title": "Answer.AI - Your AI tutor",
    "description": "Take your learning to the next level with Answer.AI, the AI-powered tutor, counselor, and life coach available 24/7 to help you crush your goals. From step-by-step problem solving to personalized flashcards, seamless study groups, and college admissions support, Answer.AI helps you thrive in the classroom and beyond. \r\n\r\nDesigned by educators, Answer.AI has a community of over 6 million users who come here to learn, grow, and succeed. \r\n\r\nBuild real-world skills, from mastering math to acing your AP exams to planning financial decisions for higher education. In only five minutes, you'll sharpen your knowledge and be more prepared to take on the day. \r\n\r\nWhether you are a student, teacher, or lifelong learner, our app empowers you to learn on your own terms, focusing on your individualized needs and helping you reach each academic milestone. \r\n\r\nWhy Answer.AI? \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udccdLearn anywhere. Built for mobile from day one, Answer.AI lets you scan questions and get instant help anytime, anywhere.\r\n\ud83d\udccdMore than answers. And way more accurate. Answer.AI goes beyond quick fixes, offering deeper learning with step-by-step solutions and explanations that foster real understanding\u2014even for complex math problems.\r\n\ud83d\udccdSupport beyond academics. With new features like financial aid and counseling, Answer.AI empowers students to succeed beyond the classroom, with resources traditionally reserved for a few students.\r\n\ud83d\udccdJoin 6 million+ learners. We're an award-winning app founded by educators, and the results prove it. Our students report improved clarity on academic subjects, boosted confidence, and more key cognitive and logical reasoning skills. \r\n\ud83d\udccdAccess to 100+ hours of resources. From in-app features to create flashcards and get quizzed, to a repository of webinars and articles, you'll have dozens of ways to level up your learning. \r\n\r\nYou'll be able to chat with AskAI, find a study group, and more as soon as you sign up. If you want to continue using some of our Premium features, you can subscribe to Answer.AI's paid plans. Have an ad-free experience with features like voice chat, AP study plans, scholarship advising and higher-quality, faster solutions!\r\nSend any feedback to support@answerai.pro",
    "descriptionHTML": "Take your learning to the next level with Answer.AI, the AI-powered tutor, counselor, and life coach available 24/7 to help you crush your goals. From step-by-step problem solving to personalized flashcards, seamless study groups, and college admissions support, Answer.AI helps you thrive in the classroom and beyond. <br><br>Designed by educators, Answer.AI has a community of over 6 million users who come here to learn, grow, and succeed. <br><br>Build real-world skills, from mastering math to acing your AP exams to planning financial decisions for higher education. In only five minutes, you&#39;ll sharpen your knowledge and be more prepared to take on the day. <br><br>Whether you are a student, teacher, or lifelong learner, our app empowers you to learn on your own terms, focusing on your individualized needs and helping you reach each academic milestone. <br><br>Why Answer.AI? <br><br>\ud83d\udccdLearn anywhere. Built for mobile from day one, Answer.AI lets you scan questions and get instant help anytime, anywhere.<br>\ud83d\udccdMore than answers. And way more accurate. Answer.AI goes beyond quick fixes, offering deeper learning with step-by-step solutions and explanations that foster real understanding\u2014even for complex math problems.<br>\ud83d\udccdSupport beyond academics. With new features like financial aid and counseling, Answer.AI empowers students to succeed beyond the classroom, with resources traditionally reserved for a few students.<br>\ud83d\udccdJoin 6 million+ learners. We&#39;re an award-winning app founded by educators, and the results prove it. Our students report improved clarity on academic subjects, boosted confidence, and more key cognitive and logical reasoning skills. <br>\ud83d\udccdAccess to 100+ hours of resources. From in-app features to create flashcards and get quizzed, to a repository of webinars and articles, you&#39;ll have dozens of ways to level up your learning. <br><br>You&#39;ll be able to chat with AskAI, find a study group, and more as soon as you sign up. If you want to continue using some of our Premium features, you can subscribe to Answer.AI&#39;s paid plans. Have an ad-free experience with features like voice chat, AP study plans, scholarship advising and higher-quality, faster solutions!<br>Send any feedback to support@answerai.pro",
